OL,3,GNEWSATeenage girl admits murder in row
OL,4,Aover boy
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager has admitted murdering a
OL,7,F16-year-old girl who she stabbed to
OL,8,Fdeath in a pre-planned fight over a
OL,9,Fboy.
OL,11,FLeeds Crown Court heard that Chloe
OL,12,FWatson Dransfield was attacked by
OL,13,F18-year-old Kayla Smith after going to
OL,14,FSmith's home with her boyfriend Blake
OL,15,FDowling in the early hours of 28 March.
OL,17,FSmith had pleaded guilty to
OL,18,Fmanslaughter but denied murder. She
OL,19,Fthen changed her plea to guilty on the
OL,20,Fsecond day of her trial.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
